      content:
        "\n# Reading your first month of data\n\nOnce you have two to four weeks of entries, the numbers start to tell a story. This lesson shows how to read it without overthinking.\n\n## The monthly total\n\nIn Reports, select the current month. The headline number is your net — income minus expenses — converted to your household's base currency.\n\n## By category\n\nThe bar chart groups spending by category. Look for the two or three biggest bars — that's where a small change has the biggest effect.\n\n## What not to do yet\n\nDon't set a dozen budgets at once. Pick the one or two categories that surprised you and set a soft limit there first.\n",
      html: '<div class="prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none"><h1 id="reading-your-first-month-of-data" class="mb-4 mt-6 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Reading your first month of data</h1><p class="my-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground">Once you have two to four weeks of entries, the numbers start to tell a story. This lesson shows how to read it without overthinking.</p><h2 id="the-monthly-total" class="mb-3 mt-6 border-b pb-2 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-xl">The monthly total</h2><p class="my-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground">In Reports, select the current month. The headline number is your net — income minus expenses — converted to your household&#39;s base currency.</p><h2 id="by-category" class="mb-3 mt-6 border-b pb-2 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-xl">By category</h2><p class="my-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground">The bar chart groups spending by category. Look for the two or three biggest bars — that&#39;s where a small change has the biggest effect.</p><h2 id="what-not-to-do-yet" class="mb-3 mt-6 border-b pb-2 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-xl">What not to do yet</h2><p class="my-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground">Don&#39;t set a dozen budgets at once. Pick the one or two categories that surprised you and set a soft limit there first.</p></div>',
